WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 43=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:41.120 --> 01:42.799
I have so many reasons to live.

01:43.239 --> 01:44.040
What about you?

01:44.640 --> 01:45.799
I love eating qingtuan.

01:46.239 --> 01:48.560
I also love crystal duck and tofu buns.

01:48.959 --> 01:51.079
I love sleeping in with Mother.

01:51.519 --> 01:54.519
I love reading
and playing with my brother.

01:54.760 --> 01:56.920
And I love going
to the theater with Aunt Lanxiang.

01:57.080 --> 01:59.950
I also love going on spring outings
outside the city and flying kites.

02:00.000 --> 02:02.290
I love beating a little drum
for my third younger brother.

02:02.719 --> 02:05.519
I love the pearl hairpin
Aunt Suhua gave me.

02:07.159 --> 02:09.039
I have so many reasons to live, too.

02:09.150 --> 02:10.360
There are too many to name.

02:13.520 --> 02:14.759
Yingzhi is right.

02:15.039 --> 02:16.800
We have so many reasons to live.

02:17.120 --> 02:19.039
We couldn't possibly
name them all at once.

02:19.192 --> 02:20.280
But one thing is certain.

02:21.759 --> 02:23.919
We certainly don't live
just to put the jade

02:23.919 --> 02:26.000
in Aunt Fengxian's room.

02:33.599 --> 02:34.800
I was born a servant,

02:35.479 --> 02:36.680
into a poor family.

02:37.159 --> 02:38.520
You lost your father and have had

02:38.616 --> 02:40.104
to live under someone else's roof.

02:40.159 --> 02:41.120
Those are all facts.

02:42.000 --> 02:43.560
But no matter what others say,

02:43.800 --> 02:44.960
as long as we know

02:45.400 --> 02:47.120
what we ourselves live for,

02:47.759 --> 02:48.439
all those words

02:49.120 --> 02:50.719
are nothing but filth.

02:52.560 --> 02:53.639
I understand now.

02:53.640 --> 02:56.460
Keep our hearts true, follow the right
path, and go far with steady steps.

02:56.479 --> 02:58.560
Only then can
we be worthy of Mother's love and care,

02:58.800 --> 03:00.919
and worthy
of the lives we've been given.

03:03.800 --> 03:04.599
Aunt Lanxiang,

03:08.919 --> 03:11.039
will we be driven out?

03:13.639 --> 03:14.439
No.

03:23.840 --> 03:24.719
Old Master.

03:25.016 --> 03:26.968
- Great-Grandfather.
- Great-Grandfather.

03:28.280 --> 03:32.599
Your eldest uncle once wanted
you two to take your mother's surname.

03:33.319 --> 03:34.520
I refused.

03:35.319 --> 03:37.000
Being entered into the family genealogy

03:37.319 --> 03:39.319
is not a decision to be made on a whim.

03:40.719 --> 03:43.919
Now, are you both willing

03:44.360 --> 03:47.759
to give up your father's
surname and take your mother's?

03:58.840 --> 03:59.840
- We are.
- We are.

04:07.719 --> 04:09.120
From this day forward,

04:10.199 --> 04:12.400
(Lin Zhangjun)
Lin Zhangjun and Lin Zhangzhi

04:12.800 --> 04:15.159
(Lin Zhangzhi)
are descendants of the Lin family.

04:16.399 --> 04:20.120
As long as they commit no crimes,

04:21.519 --> 04:22.600
no one

04:24.120 --> 04:27.639
may drive them out of the Lin Residence.

04:33.000 --> 04:33.399
You...

04:35.120 --> 04:35.519
This...

04:39.240 --> 04:40.839
You've lost your senses!

04:41.519 --> 04:42.720
How could you do

04:42.730 --> 04:44.490
something so disgraceful
and foolish? You...

04:44.920 --> 04:46.480
This is outrageous!

04:47.800 --> 04:49.279
My eldest grandson's wife,

04:49.720 --> 04:50.680
Xu,

04:51.600 --> 04:55.240
is broad-minded and noble in character,

04:55.839 --> 04:57.759
and worthy of great responsibility.

05:02.040 --> 05:03.480
From this day forward,

05:04.120 --> 05:05.839
the management of the Lin household

05:07.079 --> 05:08.800
is entrusted to you.

05:17.120 --> 05:20.079
You may decide
how Cheng is to be dealt with.

05:45.079 --> 05:46.680
Zhangzhi, get up.

05:57.079 --> 05:59.560
Fengxian comes from a family of scholars

05:59.720 --> 06:01.208
and is well-versed in the classics.

06:01.560 --> 06:02.399
Within one year,

06:02.400 --> 06:04.312
you will remain
in your room and copy the Diamond Sutra

06:04.399 --> 06:06.000
a thousand times for the First Madam.

06:08.279 --> 06:08.639
I...

06:14.020 --> 06:16.740
(Spirit Tablet
of the Late Madam Qin of the Lin Family)

06:19.199 --> 06:21.079
For Aunt Lingxiao's sake,

06:21.448 --> 06:22.950
I won't punish you publicly today.

06:28.712 --> 06:30.190
Thank Lanxiang for showing her mercy.

06:30.279 --> 06:31.959
Thank Lanxiang for showing her mercy!

06:33.199 --> 06:34.399
If this happens again,

06:34.904 --> 06:37.352
I'll have no choice but
to write to the Cheng family and ask

06:37.519 --> 06:39.279
how they raised their daughter.

06:43.310 --> 06:46.296
Thank you, Lanxiang, for your leniency.

06:47.820 --> 06:51.780
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

06:53.500 --> 06:57.340
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

06:57.700 --> 07:00.740
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

07:01.460 --> 07:03.660
♪Though all the world may fade♪

07:03.660 --> 07:06.580
♪Time rolls on
as countless lives rush by♪

07:08.340 --> 07:12.580
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

07:15.460 --> 07:19.220
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

07:21.220 --> 07:25.140
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

07:25.780 --> 07:28.260
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

07:29.260 --> 07:35.140
♪While whispers
of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

07:35.740 --> 07:39.660
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

07:39.660 --> 07:42.860
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

07:42.860 --> 07:46.860
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

07:46.860 --> 07:49.460
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

07:49.460 --> 07:53.780
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

07:53.780 --> 07:56.900
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

07:57.220 --> 08:00.820
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

08:00.820 --> 08:04.740
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

08:20.460 --> 08:24.780
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

08:27.380 --> 08:31.820
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

08:33.580 --> 08:37.340
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

08:37.980 --> 08:40.660
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

08:41.460 --> 08:47.580
♪While whispers
of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

08:47.580 --> 08:52.020
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

08:52.020 --> 08:55.020
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

08:55.020 --> 08:59.060
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

08:59.060 --> 09:03.020
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

09:03.660 --> 09:07.980
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

09:07.980 --> 09:11.100
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

09:11.100 --> 09:14.940
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

09:14.940 --> 09:17.740
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

09:17.740 --> 09:20.340
(Seven Years Later)

09:20.340 --> 09:21.860
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

09:21.860 --> 09:25.140
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

09:25.140 --> 09:29.020
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

09:29.020 --> 09:35.300
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

09:39.440 --> 09:41.320
Xiulai, if you're ever
unsure about something,

09:41.559 --> 09:42.879
you can come discuss it with me.

09:43.759 --> 09:44.759
If I'm not around,

09:45.000 --> 09:48.759
there are still
Suhua, Fengxian, and Qiuluo.

09:50.679 --> 09:52.840
Two heads are better than one.

09:53.480 --> 09:56.320
There's always
a solution to every problem.

09:56.960 --> 09:57.879
Don't worry, Lanxiang.

09:58.559 --> 09:59.799
I'll handle whatever I can.

09:59.976 --> 10:02.200
If there's anything I can't
or don't know how to handle,

10:02.376 --> 10:04.296
I'll be sure to ask all of you for help.

10:09.039 --> 10:10.960
Though we are one family,

10:11.080 --> 10:12.360
our bonds come first.

10:13.240 --> 10:16.600
But the nation has its laws,
and every family has its rules.

10:17.519 --> 10:19.679
Without rules, there can be no order.

10:20.840 --> 10:22.200
If anyone breaks the family rules,

10:22.919 --> 10:24.759
I will punish them
severely without exception.

10:26.376 --> 10:28.080
I hope you will all bear this in mind.

10:28.720 --> 10:31.559
A family that does good
will be blessed for generations.

10:32.159 --> 10:35.399
A family that does evil will
bring misfortune upon its descendants.

10:40.679 --> 10:41.600
- Yes.
- Yes.

10:42.240 --> 10:44.088
- Yes, Madam.
- Yes, Madam.

10:54.270 --> 10:57.688
(Lin Zhangcheng, age seven)
Zhangcheng!

10:57.704 --> 10:59.480
(Lin Zhangrun, son
of Lin Jinqi and Xu Lanxiang, age four)

10:59.480 --> 11:01.000
Zhangcheng, I want it.

11:01.279 --> 11:02.639
Come on. Come to me.

11:05.176 --> 11:06.200
Zhangcheng, slow down.

11:07.960 --> 11:09.600
Come on.
Let's play with this, all right?

11:09.759 --> 11:11.120
Zhangcheng, slow down.

11:11.399 --> 11:12.000
Be careful.

11:12.000 --> 11:12.720
I know, Father.

11:13.759 --> 11:15.159
Mother cried and made such a fuss,

11:15.600 --> 11:17.799
saying that all her gray hair
was caused by me.

11:19.048 --> 11:20.488
Nothing she says will change my mind.

11:20.670 --> 11:22.136
I've made up my mind not to marry.

11:23.120 --> 11:25.200
Lanxiang,
won't you try to talk her around?

11:26.600 --> 11:28.240
Life is only a few short decades.

11:28.536 --> 11:31.032
What matters most is that
she's happy with her own life.

11:36.536 --> 11:38.040
Your mother-in-law, Old Madam Yuan,

11:38.050 --> 11:39.160
just couldn't let things go.

11:39.240 --> 11:40.480
Don't be like her.

11:41.240 --> 11:43.480
She insisted on taking
concubines just to have a grandson

11:43.799 --> 11:45.240
and even took two in succession.

11:45.832 --> 11:47.890
Both were chosen
after consulting a fortune-teller.

11:47.960 --> 11:48.879
And what happened?

11:49.440 --> 11:51.399
Two more
granddaughters were born in a row.

11:53.639 --> 11:56.159
Old Madam Yuan
practically worried herself to death.

11:57.879 --> 12:00.840
Old Madam Yuan died
after becoming gravely ill.

12:03.240 --> 12:03.720
Right.

12:04.679 --> 12:05.679
She died of illness.

12:06.200 --> 12:07.279
It was illness.

12:07.559 --> 12:08.960
Xiuwan is right.

12:10.039 --> 12:11.960
What is meant
to be yours will come to you.

12:12.639 --> 12:15.240
What is not meant
to be yours should not be forced.

12:16.904 --> 12:19.600
There's nothing wrong with
staying single and carefree for life.

12:22.919 --> 12:23.840
Let's play with this.

12:25.840 --> 12:27.840
Your Lordship!

12:29.639 --> 12:30.320
Your Lordship!

12:32.720 --> 12:33.159
Baogai.

12:38.000 --> 12:38.679
What is it?

12:40.159 --> 12:40.799
His Majesty...

12:42.559 --> 12:45.279
His Majesty has passed away.

12:54.159 --> 12:56.080
Mother...

13:01.840 --> 13:02.879
When did it happen?

13:04.879 --> 13:07.559
At three quarters past the Hour of Yin,
on the first of this month.

13:08.879 --> 13:10.039
Eighteen days ago.

13:12.056 --> 13:13.390
What about the Eldest Prince?

13:15.000 --> 13:17.080
The new Emperor
has already ascended the throne.

13:35.639 --> 13:36.480
Head Butler,

13:36.799 --> 13:38.720
you and Baogai quickly
send people separately

13:38.799 --> 13:40.540
to notify
everyone else in the household.

13:40.559 --> 13:42.700
The entire household
will observe national mourning.

13:42.744 --> 13:43.630
No meat is to be eaten.

13:43.879 --> 13:45.120
No drinking or festivities.

13:45.919 --> 13:46.679
Yes.

13:51.480 --> 13:52.200
Lanxiang,

13:52.559 --> 13:53.720
I must hurry back.

13:55.559 --> 13:55.960
All right.

14:04.080 --> 14:04.519
Let's go.

14:04.600 --> 14:06.320
I'll take you to change your clothes.

14:06.536 --> 14:07.960
Then we'll have some sweet cakes.

14:09.480 --> 14:10.000
Go on.

14:10.399 --> 14:11.399
All right, Mother.

14:35.559 --> 14:36.679
By that reckoning,

14:36.919 --> 14:39.759
Fengtai and I are already family.

14:39.760 --> 14:41.368
Your Highness, hold on a little longer.

14:41.370 --> 14:42.360
We're out of the city...

14:42.360 --> 14:44.879
I'm fine. Full speed ahead.

14:45.320 --> 14:47.960
The Crown Prince has returned!

14:51.200 --> 14:53.679
This firearm was just
forged by the Imperial Armory.

14:53.816 --> 14:55.976
I grant you
special permission to carry it with you.

14:57.180 --> 15:01.660
♪Yet fate stains my sleeves with blood♪

15:01.980 --> 15:06.060
♪Raindrops fall,
one by one, into my dreams♪

15:07.660 --> 15:09.780
♪If they should wake me♪

15:09.780 --> 15:12.500
♪Hardship will always remain♪

15:12.500 --> 15:17.980
♪Amid treacherous waters,
few make it to the end♪

15:17.980 --> 15:22.940
♪How could a thousand words
soothe this aching heart?♪

15:22.940 --> 15:28.300
♪With guilt in my heart,
how could I ask to meet again?♪

15:29.940 --> 15:35.020
♪May I be like
a firefly awakening in the dark♪

15:37.112 --> 15:39.360
The late Emperor stood
by you through difficult times.

15:40.679 --> 15:41.919
Later, let's go together

15:42.168 --> 15:44.328
and burn some paper
offerings for the late Emperor

15:45.120 --> 15:46.559
as a small gesture of farewell.

15:46.559 --> 15:50.980
♪I'd spend every dawn
and dusk to see it through♪

15:53.519 --> 15:57.039
I still vividly remember how we

15:58.600 --> 16:00.200
rode side by side and fled Jinling.

16:02.639 --> 16:06.440
Now we are separated by life and death,

16:08.200 --> 16:09.480
with only memories left.

16:16.240 --> 16:18.879
Though the late Emperor loved crickets,

16:20.759 --> 16:22.039
he still knew when to stop.

16:23.416 --> 16:25.000
He could be considered a worthy ruler.

16:26.960 --> 16:27.960
But the new Emperor...

16:40.000 --> 16:44.799
I'll be more careful
with my words and actions from now on.

17:06.900 --> 17:11.100
(One Year Later)

17:23.100 --> 17:25.180
(For Imperial Use)

17:49.500 --> 17:52.360
(Commander Ding, Third-Rank,
Commander of the Longjiang Garrison)

17:52.440 --> 17:53.280
(For Imperial Use)

18:04.200 --> 18:07.960
The undefeated General Blackhead

18:08.359 --> 18:11.759
(Attendant Eunuch Mao, Fourth-Rank)
met a brutal death at the hands

18:11.759 --> 18:13.200
(Attendant Eunuch
of the Directorate of Ceremonial)

18:13.200 --> 18:14.160
of river bandits.

18:24.519 --> 18:27.640
The river bandits'
methods are brutal and bloody,

18:28.559 --> 18:30.240
and utterly appalling.

18:31.079 --> 18:33.480
This cannot be tolerated.

18:42.200 --> 18:45.400
This is all because the Longjiang
Garrison is utterly incompetent

18:45.544 --> 18:47.576
and failed
in its duty to provide protection.

18:49.128 --> 18:51.590
Eunuch Wang spared
your families from collective punishment

18:51.944 --> 18:54.640
and granted the Longjiang Garrison
special permission to raise funds

18:54.759 --> 18:56.880
to compensate
for the plundered tribute goods.

18:57.279 --> 19:01.599
That is already
an extraordinary act of mercy.

19:02.344 --> 19:03.590
(Xu Guangyi, Duke Xiangguo)

19:03.599 --> 19:06.359
(Jinling Defense Commander, Commander)
Attendant Eunuch Mao is right.

19:06.360 --> 19:07.000
(of the Central Military Command)

19:08.799 --> 19:09.599
Now,

19:10.759 --> 19:13.160
Commander Ding
has been killed by the river bandits,

19:14.640 --> 19:17.480
leaving the post of Commander
of the Longjiang Garrison vacant.

19:20.060 --> 19:21.592
(Xu Sizi, son
of Duke Xiangguo, Fourth-Rank,)

19:21.592 --> 19:22.860
(Assistant Commander
of the Jinling Imperial Guard)

19:30.152 --> 19:31.752
Marquis Lin, Eunuch Wang holds

19:31.992 --> 19:34.720
the esteemed post of Chief Eunuch
of the Directorate of Ceremonial

19:34.720 --> 19:36.520
and attends
to countless affairs each day,

19:36.536 --> 19:38.550
yet he has not forgotten an old friend.

19:38.760 --> 19:41.352
Knowing that you have been
without an official post for years,

19:41.400 --> 19:44.350
he personally petitioned
His Majesty on your behalf

19:44.440 --> 19:47.720
to appoint you Commander
of the Longjiang Garrison.

19:48.240 --> 19:50.079
You must ensure that
the Longjiang Garrison

19:50.279 --> 19:53.599
compensates for the plundered
tribute goods as soon as possible.

19:53.928 --> 19:56.312
I'm grateful
for Eunuch Wang's confidence in me.

19:56.680 --> 19:58.440
I'll do everything I can

19:58.696 --> 20:00.792
to raise
the compensation as soon as possible.

20:01.160 --> 20:02.400
More importantly,

20:02.960 --> 20:06.279
we must bring the river
bandits who plundered the tribute goods

20:06.279 --> 20:07.640
to justice

20:07.880 --> 20:12.119
and avenge General Blackhead.

20:14.520 --> 20:17.112
I will do everything
in my power to track down the killers

20:17.440 --> 20:18.880
and ease His Majesty's burden.

20:21.160 --> 20:25.440
Avenge General Blackhead.

20:37.880 --> 20:39.160
Attendant Eunuch Mao is right.

20:46.820 --> 20:49.060
(Longjiang Pass Wharf)

20:51.240 --> 20:52.039
Your Lord.

20:53.720 --> 20:56.680
A Third-Rank Commander
was brutally tortured and killed.

20:57.128 --> 20:58.960
These river bandits
clearly have no regard

20:58.960 --> 21:00.880
for the laws of the imperial court.

21:00.936 --> 21:02.400
Their methods are clearly ruthless

21:02.400 --> 21:03.519
and far from ordinary.

21:04.599 --> 21:08.119
The Longjiang Garrison lacks
military funds and equipment.

21:08.559 --> 21:10.240
Now its troops are demoralized.

21:10.712 --> 21:11.992
You're asking them to...

21:14.488 --> 21:16.360
You're asking them
to bankrupt themselves

21:16.370 --> 21:18.030
to compensate for the tribute goods,

21:18.400 --> 21:20.400
and also to capture the river bandits.

21:20.440 --> 21:21.839
How could that possibly work?

21:27.680 --> 21:29.119
I'm getting old.

21:29.359 --> 21:31.599
My hearing isn't what it used to be.

21:32.400 --> 21:33.400
Not what it used to be.

22:07.144 --> 22:09.832
Unfortunately, I've just
received orders from the Ministry of War

22:10.136 --> 22:12.712
to oversee Zhejiang's coastal
defenses against the Wo pirates.

22:13.799 --> 22:16.279
I'll be leaving Jinling soon

22:16.360 --> 22:18.152
to take up my post
on the Zhejiang coast.

22:19.799 --> 22:21.759
I won't be able
to lend you a hand, Fengtai.

22:24.296 --> 22:26.520
Investigating cases
is something I'm fairly good at.

22:27.599 --> 22:29.480
No matter
how good you are at investigating,

22:30.079 --> 22:32.039
you still need
capable men under your command.

22:32.359 --> 22:34.880
The compensation
for the tribute goods is no small sum.

22:35.640 --> 22:37.720
If the soldiers are driven into ruin,

22:38.079 --> 22:39.799
they're bound to harbor resentment.

22:40.599 --> 22:42.640
Why would they still
take orders from you?

22:45.912 --> 22:47.880
I've already submitted
a memorial to His Majesty

22:47.992 --> 22:49.350
proposing reforms to naval service.

22:49.912 --> 22:52.720
The conscription system would be
replaced with government-paid labor.

22:53.680 --> 22:57.079
All military households would
share the cost according to their means.

22:57.920 --> 22:59.960
This way, poorer households

23:00.160 --> 23:02.880
wouldn't be ruined
when assigned minor service duties,

23:03.200 --> 23:04.279
while well-off households

23:04.720 --> 23:06.519
could also be spared
the burden of service.

23:07.240 --> 23:08.440
Will His Majesty approve it?

23:11.480 --> 23:13.110
The compensation His Majesty receives

23:13.200 --> 23:14.599
will be paid in full.

23:15.480 --> 23:17.510
It will also prevent
the soldiers from mutinying.

23:18.472 --> 23:20.270
Even if His Majesty doesn't understand,

23:21.200 --> 23:22.240
the Grand Secretariat will.

23:22.776 --> 23:24.000
They will certainly approve it.

23:24.400 --> 23:25.960
The eunuchs wield great power now.

23:28.200 --> 23:29.160
You must be careful.

23:35.720 --> 23:37.912
Our coastal defenses
are short of troops now.

23:38.599 --> 23:39.880
You be careful, too.

23:49.220 --> 23:54.540
(The Tale of Suppressing the Bandits)

24:24.860 --> 24:27.440
(The Tale of Suppressing
the Bandits: The General, Tanniang)

24:27.440 --> 24:28.920
The Tale of Suppressing the Bandits?

24:30.359 --> 24:31.759
The general, Tanniang,

24:33.119 --> 24:34.240
is a woman?

24:34.680 --> 24:35.960
Do you think, Marquis Lin,

24:36.359 --> 24:37.920
that women cannot be generals?

24:39.440 --> 24:40.759
The Shang dynasty had Fu Hao.

24:40.960 --> 24:42.359
The Sui dynasty had Madam Xian.

24:42.600 --> 24:44.200
The Tang dynasty had Princess Pingyang.

24:44.720 --> 24:47.079
Which of them achieved
any less than male generals?

24:51.920 --> 24:53.599
Your husband is poorly learned,

24:54.000 --> 24:55.640
and bound by outdated conventions.

24:56.160 --> 24:57.319
I spoke rashly just now.

24:57.799 --> 24:59.400
Please forgive me, my lady.

25:01.920 --> 25:03.599
Don't underestimate the play I wrote.

25:03.848 --> 25:05.340
Even the vendors selling wooden swords

25:05.359 --> 25:07.079
at the Imperial Theater

25:07.200 --> 25:09.192
have seen
their earnings rise by thirty percent.

25:09.319 --> 25:10.960
Zhangcheng's future shops

25:11.160 --> 25:13.599
and farmland will all
depend on this pen of mine.

25:14.136 --> 25:16.280
You really do have a knack
for running the household.

25:16.920 --> 25:19.599
I happen to have
something I'd like your advice on.

25:23.864 --> 25:26.240
Over the years, the stricter
the maritime ban has become,

25:26.312 --> 25:28.152
the more rampant the bandits have grown.

25:28.920 --> 25:31.519
River bandits even openly
attack and plunder government vessels.

25:32.640 --> 25:33.640
I understand

25:34.160 --> 25:37.000
that the late Emperor reduced the
troops, leaving us short of manpower.

25:37.400 --> 25:38.790
But without reducing the troops,

25:38.840 --> 25:40.936
the Ministry of Revenue
couldn't afford the expense.

25:43.000 --> 25:45.599
If the Ministry of Revenue had
a steady stream of tax revenue,

25:46.039 --> 25:47.759
wouldn't it be able to support the army?

25:48.839 --> 25:50.039
You mean...

25:57.740 --> 26:00.319
(To My Dear Friend, Lv Ji'er)

26:00.319 --> 26:02.200
This is a letter from Ji'er.

26:03.000 --> 26:04.119
At my request,

26:04.216 --> 26:06.712
she recorded Quanzhou's local
customs and people's livelihoods

26:06.720 --> 26:07.640
in detail.

26:12.060 --> 26:14.759
(Pepper: 0.24 taels per kg.
Agarwood: 1.6 taels per kg.)

26:14.760 --> 26:16.824
These are
the prices around Jinling and Suzhou

26:16.872 --> 26:19.440
that I collected for writing my plays.

26:24.420 --> 26:25.720
(Pepper: 0.24 taels per kg.
Agarwood: 1.6 taels per kg.)

26:25.720 --> 26:27.640
The profits really are substantial.

26:28.839 --> 26:30.400
No wonder Jinqiao was tempted.

26:31.544 --> 26:33.830
How did Yu the Great
succeed in controlling the floods?

26:34.599 --> 26:36.119
He simply followed eight words.

26:36.960 --> 26:40.559
Better to channel than block,
better to guide than channel.

26:42.799 --> 26:43.440
Exactly.

26:44.359 --> 26:46.599
If the imperial court
allowed maritime trade

26:47.440 --> 26:48.880
and properly regulated and guided it,

26:49.519 --> 26:51.279
the people could not only earn a living,

26:52.039 --> 26:53.000
but the government

26:53.128 --> 26:55.112
would also have
a steady stream of tax revenue.

26:56.279 --> 26:57.119
Unfortunately,

26:57.680 --> 26:59.440
pirates and Wo pirates are rampant now.

27:00.039 --> 27:01.839
Even without the imperial maritime ban,

27:02.040 --> 27:03.750
maritime trade would still be difficult.

27:06.456 --> 27:09.112
Chengze has been transferred
to reorganize the coastal defenses.

27:09.640 --> 27:12.472
It's the perfect opportunity
to eliminate the pirates and Wo pirates.

27:13.880 --> 27:16.039
I'm now Commander
of the Longjiang Garrison,

27:16.319 --> 27:18.279
so I can also wipe out the river bandits

27:18.328 --> 27:19.680
and strengthen the river defenses.

27:20.160 --> 27:21.960
Once peace
is restored throughout the land,

27:22.952 --> 27:25.550
we can abolish the tribute
system and lift the maritime ban.

27:25.880 --> 27:27.559
The cotton grown by the people

27:27.560 --> 27:28.790
and the cotton cloth they weave

27:28.920 --> 27:30.960
could then be sold
overseas in a steady stream

27:31.240 --> 27:32.200
in exchange for silver.

27:32.599 --> 27:35.519
Commander of the Longjiang Garrison?

27:48.319 --> 27:49.920
I was appointed just today.

27:51.400 --> 27:52.799
I was about to tell you,

27:53.119 --> 27:54.519
but then I saw the play you wrote.

27:54.536 --> 27:56.590
It was so beautifully
written and so captivating

27:57.119 --> 28:00.960
that I completely forgot.

28:08.519 --> 28:09.680
You brazen bandits!

28:09.759 --> 28:11.440
I'm standing right here!

28:11.559 --> 28:12.759
Surrender now,

28:12.960 --> 28:14.839
or you will be shown no mercy!

28:23.704 --> 28:25.110
Running around like a madwoman.

28:25.240 --> 28:27.080
Is that any way
for a young lady to behave?

28:32.880 --> 28:34.599
Are you trying to anger me to death?

28:35.799 --> 28:38.000
General Wang, your timing is perfect!

28:38.119 --> 28:40.759
We'll attack them from both sides

28:40.960 --> 28:44.039
and wipe out
the bandits in one fell swoop!

28:46.039 --> 28:48.200
Why don't
you wipe me out while you're at it?

28:48.559 --> 28:50.519
Are you trying to anger me to death?

28:50.839 --> 28:51.720
You really...

28:53.240 --> 28:53.640
This...

28:55.839 --> 28:56.200
I...

28:56.480 --> 28:59.559
How did I ever
raise a daughter like you?

29:02.359 --> 29:03.640
Mother, please don't cry.

29:04.776 --> 29:07.768
- You're driving me to my grave!
- I'll behave like a proper young lady.

29:08.400 --> 29:09.799
Will that do?

29:12.160 --> 29:12.839
You...

29:12.920 --> 29:13.839
Mother.

29:19.279 --> 29:22.079
Old Master is getting older by the day.

29:22.519 --> 29:24.359
One day, he'll be gone.

29:25.519 --> 29:28.319
Then the first and second branches
will divide the family property.

29:28.808 --> 29:30.790
No matter
how good Jinqi and Lanxiang are to you,

29:31.319 --> 29:32.880
they belong to a different branch.

29:33.319 --> 29:35.359
You won't be able
to rely on them in the future.

29:36.519 --> 29:37.759
I have you, Mother.

29:39.440 --> 29:41.319
Can I stay with you forever?

29:41.680 --> 29:43.519
I'll be gone sooner or later, too.

29:44.640 --> 29:45.519
In our branch,

29:46.319 --> 29:48.720
Fengxian will be in charge from then on.

29:49.359 --> 29:52.720
She's as petty as they come.

29:53.279 --> 29:54.960
If you have to depend on her,

29:55.480 --> 29:56.839
how could you possibly live well?

29:59.032 --> 30:01.110
You should find
a husband and marry while you can.

30:05.160 --> 30:06.839
Mother has prepared a dowry for me.

30:07.240 --> 30:08.480
I won't need to depend on her.

30:11.279 --> 30:13.000
Your dowry?

30:13.279 --> 30:15.680
It won't be yours until you're married.

30:16.839 --> 30:19.160
An unmarried
daughter cannot own property.

30:20.088 --> 30:22.350
When the time comes,
not a single thing in this residence

30:22.359 --> 30:23.799
will belong to you.

30:25.440 --> 30:27.519
And you call me foolish?

30:29.359 --> 30:31.759
You're the foolish one!

30:47.400 --> 30:48.680
I'll find a way

30:49.079 --> 30:50.400
to earn enough to support myself.

30:52.839 --> 30:55.920
What can a woman like you possibly do?

31:02.720 --> 31:03.720
Be a good girl

31:04.160 --> 31:06.960
and marry
Second Master You as his second wife.

31:07.960 --> 31:08.920
Then at least

31:10.359 --> 31:12.039
you'll have someone to rely on.

31:12.380 --> 31:16.180
♪Yet I must still smile through it all♪

31:16.180 --> 31:18.740
♪Those things I can't forget♪

31:18.740 --> 31:22.820
♪The absurdities
I can't let go of fill every page♪

31:23.060 --> 31:24.860
♪Building a wall♪

31:24.860 --> 31:28.540
♪Trapped in the midst of time♪

31:28.540 --> 31:32.460
♪Drifting with the wind♪

31:32.940 --> 31:36.540
(Jinling Lin Family Zezhi Workshop)

31:36.540 --> 31:37.940
(Zezhi Workshop)

31:39.064 --> 31:40.792
What are you looking at? Get moving.

31:42.140 --> 31:45.980
(Zezhi Workshop)

32:05.336 --> 32:07.400
Our Zezhi Workshop's
looms and weaving techniques

32:07.464 --> 32:09.128
are the most advanced available today.

32:09.512 --> 32:11.800
I've taken care
of everything over there. Don't worry.

32:13.839 --> 32:15.119
This is our Xiaobu cloth,

32:15.599 --> 32:16.880
priced at 2 coins per bolt.

32:17.240 --> 32:19.519
Feihua cloth is 6 coins per bolt.

32:19.576 --> 32:20.790
As for waist-loom ramie cloth,

32:20.920 --> 32:22.759
it's 3.5 coins per bolt.

32:24.184 --> 32:26.240
Now take a look
at our coarse white cotton cloth.

32:26.519 --> 32:28.559
It's 0.94 coin for three meters.

32:28.808 --> 32:31.110
Fine three-shuttle cloth
is 0.9 coin for three meters.

32:31.400 --> 32:34.160
Fine blue cotton cloth
is 1.05 coins for three meters.

32:35.640 --> 32:37.279
If I place a larger order,

32:38.039 --> 32:40.440
could you offer me
a better price, Shopkeeper Zhou?

32:41.799 --> 32:44.079
Of course
we offer discounts to major customers.

32:45.940 --> 32:48.140
(Gu Youzi, Lady Peng)

33:00.312 --> 33:01.496
Second Young Lady.

33:02.400 --> 33:03.480
Lady Peng, what is it?

33:03.880 --> 33:06.319
The Head Shopkeeper arranged
to inspect the latest waist looms

33:06.319 --> 33:07.440
at Han Family Village
outside the city today.

33:07.440 --> 33:09.144
If we don't leave now, we'll be late.

33:09.440 --> 33:12.119
The latest single-heddle,
double-treadle twill loom?

33:12.640 --> 33:13.039
Yes.

33:13.192 --> 33:14.390
That's right, Shopkeeper Zhou.

33:14.480 --> 33:17.119
How much can you produce here in a day?

33:17.519 --> 33:18.799
Shopkeeper Zhou is busy.

33:18.920 --> 33:19.839
I'll go with you.

33:19.920 --> 33:20.400
All right.

33:37.480 --> 33:38.680
There'll be no one on the road.

33:38.920 --> 33:40.160
You can get some fresh air, too.

33:41.752 --> 33:44.136
I'm sorry to put
you through this, Second Young Lady.

33:45.440 --> 33:46.599
With the new looms,

33:46.880 --> 33:48.400
a skilled weaver like you

33:48.480 --> 33:50.279
can weave
one extra bolt every three days.

33:50.279 --> 33:51.359
That's all money.

33:52.780 --> 33:55.112
If a little inconvenience
is all it takes to make money,

33:55.120 --> 33:56.430
I could make this trip every day.

33:56.440 --> 33:57.440
Even ten times a day.

34:54.952 --> 34:55.760
It's all my fault.

34:55.920 --> 34:56.840
This is all my fault.

34:57.016 --> 34:59.030
I was busy discussing
business with the merchants

34:59.096 --> 35:01.100
and let the Second Young Lady go
outside the city to inspect the looms.

35:01.110 --> 35:02.440
This has nothing to do with you.

35:02.728 --> 35:04.504
You couldn't
have known this would happen.

35:04.552 --> 35:07.150
How could
it have nothing to do with her?

35:08.420 --> 35:09.340
Your Lordship.

35:09.340 --> 35:12.540
(Lin Jincen, age 22.
Gan Qiuluo, Lin Jincen's wife)

35:16.519 --> 35:17.400
Any news?

35:18.264 --> 35:19.760
We've searched throughout the city.

35:22.568 --> 35:23.940
The city gates are already closed.

35:23.992 --> 35:27.064
I'll continue searching outside
the city first thing tomorrow morning.

35:28.639 --> 35:29.159
Mother.

35:35.360 --> 35:36.159
Second Madam.

35:37.440 --> 35:40.320
If anything at all happens to Xiuwan,

35:40.840 --> 35:42.559
I'll skin you alive!

35:42.960 --> 35:44.760
- Aunt Lingxiao!
- Aunt Lingxiao!

35:45.440 --> 35:46.199
Aunt Lingxiao!

35:47.920 --> 35:48.679
Aunt Lingxiao!

35:48.920 --> 35:50.320
It's not Gantang's fault.

35:50.904 --> 35:51.920
It's all because of you!

35:51.920 --> 35:52.960
Mother!

35:53.480 --> 35:55.239
You have no sense of propriety at all!

35:56.480 --> 35:58.920
It's not
Madam's fault. It's all my fault.

35:59.199 --> 36:01.599
You kept taking Xiuwan
to hear those outrageous

36:01.599 --> 36:03.039
and indecent plays.

36:03.528 --> 36:05.630
Not only did they fill
her head with improper ideas,

36:05.640 --> 36:08.200
but they also made her think
all day about earning her own money

36:08.264 --> 36:09.440
and refusing to marry!

36:09.880 --> 36:10.760
Aunt Lingxiao!

36:15.224 --> 36:16.360
Xiuwan has gone missing.

36:16.360 --> 36:17.599
We're all very worried.

36:18.264 --> 36:19.590
But she's already thirty-five.

36:19.710 --> 36:21.080
She's not a three-year-old child!

36:21.320 --> 36:22.840
What she should or shouldn't do

36:22.850 --> 36:24.510
is beyond even
your control as her mother.

36:24.800 --> 36:26.639
How can you blame
your niece-in-law for this?

36:32.719 --> 36:33.039
You...

36:39.199 --> 36:43.280
Tomorrow, Jincen and Liu Xiaochuan
will continue searching the city.

36:43.448 --> 36:45.544
Jinqiao and I
will search outside the city.

36:45.848 --> 36:47.992
We'll make sure
we give you an answer, Aunt Lingxiao.

36:48.599 --> 36:49.280
All right.

37:00.119 --> 37:02.119
My Xiuwan...

37:06.679 --> 37:07.719
Our ancestors taught us

37:07.832 --> 37:09.400
that women should be chaste and modest

37:09.480 --> 37:11.150
and should not show
themselves in public.

37:11.199 --> 37:14.079
Xiuwan followed Lanxiang
and forgot our ancestors' teachings.

37:14.216 --> 37:15.630
That's why this happened to her.

37:17.800 --> 37:19.800
It's all because of that servant Xu.

37:20.200 --> 37:21.550
She's reckless and presumptuous,

37:21.559 --> 37:22.679
with no regard for the rules!

37:22.910 --> 37:25.430
Mother, Fengxian, you're
both shouting at the top of your lungs.

37:25.440 --> 37:27.144
Do you want every servant to hear you?

37:42.280 --> 37:43.599
Mother has never had much sense.

37:43.704 --> 37:45.320
Lanxiang, please don't take it to heart.

37:50.960 --> 37:52.079
We'll be going now.

37:53.000 --> 37:54.039
Jinqi, Lanxiang.

37:54.760 --> 37:55.880
Get some rest.

38:08.639 --> 38:09.920
We'll search together tomorrow.

38:14.480 --> 38:15.000
Baogai.

38:29.239 --> 38:30.920
Xiuwan picked up the loom

38:31.070 --> 38:33.048
and went missing
on her way back to the city.

38:33.272 --> 38:34.470
First thing tomorrow morning,

38:34.480 --> 38:36.400
Gantang and I
will go back to the workshop

38:36.679 --> 38:38.519
and ask the women who know Lady Peng

38:38.800 --> 38:40.320
to see if there are any other clues.

38:42.719 --> 38:45.239
You were put through a lot today.

38:47.599 --> 38:49.320
As long as Xiuwan comes back safely,

38:50.360 --> 38:51.599
I'll ask for nothing more.

40:49.960 --> 40:50.840
What's that sound?

40:51.128 --> 40:52.184
Let's go take a look.

41:17.400 --> 41:19.960
Come on! Hurry!

41:28.159 --> 41:29.199
It's not a rabbit.

41:29.199 --> 41:30.719
Then it must be a badger.

41:44.239 --> 41:45.119
They escaped!

41:45.639 --> 41:47.199
The weavers we abducted escaped!

41:47.280 --> 41:48.119
Someone come!

41:48.119 --> 41:49.039
The weavers we abducted escaped!

41:49.039 --> 41:49.599
Someone come!

41:49.599 --> 41:50.119
Where is everyone?

41:50.119 --> 41:50.719
Get out here!

41:50.719 --> 41:51.239
Hurry!

41:51.239 --> 41:51.960
Search everywhere!

41:52.199 --> 41:52.679
Search!

41:56.079 --> 41:56.719
Come out!

41:56.719 --> 41:59.039
Fire!

41:59.920 --> 42:00.639
Fire!

42:07.700 --> 42:11.020
(Zhang Shuizai,
Leader of the Kidnappers)

42:17.199 --> 42:18.679
Get water and put out the fire.

42:18.719 --> 42:20.119
- Yes!
- Yes! Hurry!

42:33.320 --> 42:36.039
This isn't a safe place to linger.

42:55.020 --> 42:56.820
(Construction Supervisor,
Ministry of Works)

43:05.060 --> 43:07.460
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:15.380 --> 43:22.039
(Wanted)

43:22.039 --> 43:23.840
Lin Jinqi.

43:24.320 --> 43:26.119
Xu Lanxiang.

43:28.400 --> 43:30.000
It's been sixteen years.

43:33.000 --> 43:34.000
You don't even

43:35.639 --> 43:37.159
recognize me anymore?

43:55.780 --> 43:59.900
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:02.740 --> 44:07.260
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:08.540 --> 44:12.460
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:13.140 --> 44:15.900
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:16.620 --> 44:18.940
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:18.940 --> 44:22.020
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:23.540 --> 44:27.780
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:30.700 --> 44:34.860
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:36.660 --> 44:40.220
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:40.220 --> 44:43.780
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:44.580 --> 44:50.260
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:50.620 --> 44:54.940
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:55.300 --> 44:58.260
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:58.260 --> 45:02.020
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:02.020 --> 45:04.900
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:04.900 --> 45:08.980
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:08.980 --> 45:12.340
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:12.340 --> 45:16.100
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:16.100 --> 45:20.100
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:20.860 --> 45:25.020
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:25.020 --> 45:28.460
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:28.460 --> 45:32.100
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:32.100 --> 45:34.980
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:34.980 --> 45:39.060
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:39.060 --> 45:42.420
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:42.420 --> 45:46.060
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:46.060 --> 45:53.860
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
